msgctxt "56_Saejima"
msgid "Hey, Tadokoro. Who'd ya sell Tadashi's sister to?"
msgstr "Dilo, Tadokoro. ¿A quién le vendiste la hermana de Tadashi?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68_Tadokoro"
msgid "The Takasu Family..."
msgstr "A la familia Takasu..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Saejima"
msgid "And tell me. Where's this Takasu Family's office?"
msgstr "Dime, ¿dónde está la oficina de esa familia Takasu?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92_Tadokoro"
msgid "Theater Alley."
msgstr "Callejón del Teatro."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "104_Tadashi"
msgid "Poor Akiko... I can't believe he sold her to the yakuza..."
msgstr "Pobre Akiko... No puedo creer que la vendiera a los yakuza..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "116_Saejima"
msgid "C'mon. Quit whimperin' and man up."
msgstr "Vamos. Deja de lloriquear muchacho."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "128_Tadashi"
msgid "But she's gone..."
msgstr "Pero ella ya no está..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "140_Saejima"
msgid "Wrong. We know exactly where your sister is.\\r\nAll we gotta do is go pick her up."
msgstr "Incorrecto. Sabemos exactamente donde está tu hermana.\nSolo tenemos que ir a buscarla."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "152_Saejima"
msgid "But head on back to my hideout for now. We gotta talk\\r\nabout where we go from here."
msgstr "Por ahora regresa al escondite. Tenemos que planear\nque haremos a partir de ahora."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "164_Tadashi"
msgid "Okay... Yes, sir."
msgstr "Está bien... Sí, señor."

